<title>GERMANY: Bilfinger+Berger 96 output up 8 pct.</title>
<headline>Bilfinger+Berger 96 output up 8 pct.</headline>
<text>
<p>MANNHEIM, Germany, Feb 12, Reuter - Calendar year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group construction output	     9,245   vs 8,573</p>
<p>     domestic output			  4,865   vs 4,557</p>
<p>     foreign output			   4,380   vs 4,016</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		   9,940   vs 9,580</p>
<p>    Group orders in hand		    9,980   vs 9,284</p>
<p>    Group fixed asset investments	 270     vs 291</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of German construction group is Bilfinger + Berger. The group also said that its profits for the business year were largely satisfactory but below year-ago levels.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
